      "docs": {
        "pages": [],
        "readme": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "# Pudge Wars\n\nTwo banks, a river, six butchers, one hook. First team to the kill goal wins. Walk with walk_to, throw with hook_to. The river drowns. Fog hides the enemy bank. Bundled personalities: idle, camper, rusher."
        }
      },
      "name": "pudge-wars",
      "owner": "coworld@softmax.com",
      "version": "0.3.1",
      "runnable": {
        "env": {},
        "run": [
          "pwcoworld"
        ],
        "type": "game",
        "image": "img_5d160a6e-9560-47fc-b088-cd4f3414ea2a"
      },
      "protocols": {
        "global": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "GET /client/global opens /global with a live 2D overlay. Observatory replays use the static WASM bundle (native 3D renderer) with index.html?replay=<url>. The public replay copy is gzip; the viewer sniffs 1f 8b."
        },
        "player": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Connect to COWORLD_PLAYER_WS_URL. Receive JSON observations each tick; reply with {walk_to:[x,y], hook_to:[x,y], halt, ping}. Coordinates are tiles on the 128 map. Empty action is sticky. Seats 0-2 West, 3-5 East (team_pair blocks). Fog: home bank always visible; enemy bank needs ally sight. Final message type=final."
        }
      },
